      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在这当中，宝可梦中心：冬日大道的\n精灵球销量断层式垫底……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57288FD95F534E2DFF0C5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC3FF1A51AC65E5592790537684000A7CBE70757403950091CF65AD5C425F0F57AB5E952026202600100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，只要拥有某只宝可梦，\n所有问题都能迎刃而解。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n先告诉你这个作战的名称是什么吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C53EA898162E5670967D053EA5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A6240670995EE989890FD80FD8FCE5203800C89E3300200100001BE00000A5148544A8BC94F608FD94E2A4F5C62187684540D79F0662F4EC04E485427300200100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是——哎呀球真畅销计划！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F2014201454CE54407403771F754595008BA15212FF0100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我来说明一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA9621167658BF4660E4E004E0B5427300200100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "柜台的这一边\n有些冷清对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67DC53F076848FD94E008FB9000A67094E9B51B76E055BF95427FF1F00100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果这里有酷似精灵球的\n“<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>哎呀球菇<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>”在的话，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n大家就会被吸引过来买精灵球了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C8FD991CC670991774F3C7CBE707574037684000A201C00100002FF00000654CE5440740383C700100002FF000000201D572876848BDDFF0C00100001BE00000A59275BB65C314F1A88AB54385F158FC767654E707CBE707574034E86FF0100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托你了！\n请一定要把哎呀球菇让给我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
